            "detailed_description": "As a survivor of the mutant virus together with a comrade or alone, you must make your way<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthrough the city levels, every new area uncovering new challenges to overcome and mutants to<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdestroy. With a large variety of weapons at your disposal, together you must wipe out the hordes <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\tof flesh eating mutants. Teamwork is the key to survive the DEAD HORDE...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dead Horde is an action packed, co-op top down, survival-horror shooter<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Play the campaign in single-player, local co-op or online co-op with a friend<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Make your way through the levels with a huge variety of weapons. Use assault rifles, shotguns, grenades, mini-guns and a lot more to unlock during the game<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Fast paced action with seemingly never ending hordes of mutants.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Mutants evolve and become bigger, faster and stronger throughout the game.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Use vehicles solo or with a teammate to fight the mutants<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Earn money by killing mutants and buy and upgrade weapons<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
